{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conviction Chronicles</strong> is a multi-ending and dynamic horror adventure game. Your decisions will shape the story and seal the fates of everybody inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.poster.avif?t=1774288424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.webm?t=1774288424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.mp4?t=1774288424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build alliances, gather intel, and manipulate the truth. Socialize with fellow prisoners to uncover clues, forge fragile bonds, and/or quietly set up your next betrayal. Craft tools for survival\u2026 or for murder. Every inmate can be an asset if you know how to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your cell or slip into the dark to execute your plans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage rivals, plant traps, stalk your suspects, eliminate those in your way, and erase or falsify evidence before dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/40a3973c5eb2d04bb3def7a651314ec6.poster.avif?t=1774288424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/40a3973c5eb2d04bb3def7a651314ec6.webm?t=1774288424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Inmate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of 15 unique prisoners, each with distinct playstyles, motives, and branching personal stories. Learn more about them with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive Prison Ecosystem</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationships deepen or collapse based on your actions. Dynamic events and autonomous characters reshape every playthrough, <u>ensuring no two runs unfold the same way.</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft traps and weapons for self-defense, deception, and murder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate twisted cases... Or create them to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React, Retaliate, Reveal! The world is shaped by perception. Fast-paced trials will depend on your wits and lies to protect yourself from execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the mole or play as them, to secure your victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every non\u2011player inmate acts independently to survive. They can do anything the player can do behind the scenes, creating unpredictable situations, shifting alliances, and emergent trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 hours of branching paths, randomized outcomes, hidden stories, and unlockable content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter the gameplay in drastic ways to make runs as long or as short as you desire. With the expansive game settings menu, you can drastically shape the game to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/7157f5e92152f0d1fead7481ba5c0f0f.poster.avif?t=1774288424\" width=590 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/7157f5e92152f0d1fead7481ba5c0f0f.webm?t=1774288424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/7157f5e92152f0d1fead7481ba5c0f0f.mp4?t=1774288424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908320?t=1774288424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/ab8d47031427290cae3dac391895e8c3161918d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774288424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/d2049003da2c8441a8080a0e32de5bafc44bb32c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774288424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/d2049003da2c8441a8080a0e32de5bafc44bb32c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774288424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Features mechanics based around planning murders.\r\n\r\nActions done upon someone sleeping:\r\n-Murdering the victim directly.\r\n-Drugging the victim to impact how they function during the next day or to kill them with drugs.\r\n-Playing a prank. Nothing sexual is even remotely implied here.\r\n-Tying someone up to the bed so they cannot leave the room, they can be untied too.\r\n\r\nCharacters with low self esteem can commit suicide.\r\n\r\nWhen playing certain characters, the camera can be moved in such a way to view the girl's panties.\r\n\r\nMany things are up to be changed during development before the game's release."},"demos":[{"appid":3908450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conviction Chronicles</strong> is a multi-ending and dynamic horror adventure game. Your decisions will shape the story and seal the fates of everybody inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.poster.avif?t=1774288424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.webm?t=1774288424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/e694df3a53140f872cde43cd0489b009.mp4?t=1774288424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build alliances, gather intel, and manipulate the truth. Socialize with fellow prisoners to uncover clues, forge fragile bonds, and/or quietly set up your next betrayal. Craft tools for survival\u2026 or for murder. Every inmate can be an asset if you know how to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your cell or slip into the dark to execute your plans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage rivals, plant traps, stalk your suspects, eliminate those in your way, and erase or falsify evidence before dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/40a3973c5eb2d04bb3def7a651314ec6.poster.avif?t=1774288424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908320/extras/40a39